# .agent/ contains a mix of:
#   - Tracked (committed):  SOUL.md, USER.md, agents/*.md (team config)
#   - Ignored:              everything else (sessions/, memory/, settings.json,
#                           nanobot_config.json) — contain API keys, history, etc.
